{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","风雷骤怒"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤风暴持续击飞所有敌人，并持续激发“风雷晶瞳”对敌人造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","卓琳飞入高空，召唤持续4秒的风暴立即对所有敌人造成其30% + 3%生命值的伤害（不超过自身500% + 50%攻击力），风暴期间持续击飞所有敌人并使其远程防御降低20点，并且每秒激发2次“风雷晶瞳”召唤落雷攻击所有敌人造成110% + 15% ATK真实伤害，激发间隔受自身急速属性影响且每秒最多激发8次。卓琳技能期间处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":29,"end":34,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":50,"end":56,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":116,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":112,"end":126,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":162,"end":164,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至130% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至140% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","疾风汹涌"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","卓琳受到的急速属性增益提高。主动释放时在一段时间内持续激发“风雷晶瞳”对敌人造成伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，卓琳受到来自友军施加的急速属性增益效果提高100%且不会因增益消失而失去急速，但相同增益效果提供的急速属性增益不会叠加。\n主动释放时，卓琳控制“风雷晶瞳”持续2秒，每秒激发2次“风雷晶瞳”在敌人所在位置召唤小型气流（按照从前至后的顺序优先选择不同敌人），对目标周围1格范围内的敌人造成110% + 15% ATK伤害，激发间隔受自身急速属性影响且每秒最多激发8次。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":150,"end":156,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":146,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至115% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","该技能激发“风雷晶瞳”造成的伤害提高至125% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":23,"end":29,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":33,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","风刃双环"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","向距离最近和最远的敌人分别发射一团风刃，持续造成范围伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","凝聚两团风刃，分别发射向距离自身最近和最远的各一名敌人，风刃会围绕目标切割2秒，每0.5秒对目标及其周围2格范围内的敌人造成110% + 15% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":66,"end":72,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":76,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至115% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至120% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害量提高至125% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":20,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗中提升自身攻击力，每次激发“风雷晶瞳”后额外提高。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","自身提高6%攻击力，每次激发“风雷晶瞳”后额外提高0.6%，至多提高30次。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","自身提高8%攻击力，每次激发“风雷晶瞳”后额外提高0.8%，至多提高30次。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","自身提高10%攻击力，每次激发“风雷晶瞳”后额外提高1%，至多提高30次。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","永恒风暴"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","拥有一定急速属性增益后进入稳定状态并且受到伤害降低，激发一定次数的“风雷晶瞳”后召唤巨型风暴持续对敌人造成伤害，并且周期性击飞敌人。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","在战斗中拥有来自友军提供的至少60点急速增益时，卓琳进入“风涌”状态：处于稳定且受到伤害降低45%，造成伤害时无视敌人45%远程防御属性。累计激发30次“风雷晶瞳”后，卓琳制造混合雷电的巨型风暴永久覆盖战场，每秒对所有敌人造成110% ATK真实伤害，每5秒产生强气流击飞所有敌人并摧毁所有障碍物。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":39,"tooltip_key":"keyword:stable"},{"start":113,"end":121,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每秒伤害量提高至130% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每秒伤害量提高至150% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":16,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","巨型风暴中，不处于稳定或霸体状态的敌人在当前生命值低于卓琳1000%攻击力且生命值比例低于35%时，会被吹出战场，以此法吹出战场的敌人无法回到战场，视作被击败。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","“疾风汹涌”和“风刃双环”额外造成真实伤害和短暂眩晕。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“疾风汹涌”召唤的小型气流以及“风刃双环”凝聚的气旋刃均会附带雷电，每次造成伤害时额外附带30% ATK真实伤害并使目标眩晕0.25秒，同时使目标永久降低4点受愈，该效果至多叠加15层。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":47,"end":54,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","风雷晶瞳"]]}